# NHL engine credentials for the desktop shortcuts and the launchd schedule.
# Copy this to ~/.nhl_engine/engine.env (the installers do that for you) and
# fill in your values. launchd does NOT read your shell profile, so a scheduled
# capture can only reach The Odds API if the key lives here or in /etc/engine.env
# (the same key the MLB/CFB/NFL engines use is fine).
#
# Keep this file private: chmod 600 ~/.nhl_engine/engine.env. Never commit it.

# The Odds API key: https://the-odds-api.com  (ODDS_API_KEY also accepted)
THE_ODDS_API_KEY=

# --- optional: email the card (same Gmail App Password the MLB engine uses;
# already in /etc/engine.env if that engine emails you) ---
# GMAIL_USER=you@gmail.com
# GMAIL_APP_PASSWORD=
# NHLE_EMAIL_TO=you@gmail.com   (falls back to MLBE_EMAIL_TO, then GMAIL_USER)

# --- optional: capture budget ---
# Per-event markets (periods, team totals, props) cost ~25 credits per game per
# pass. Cap how many games one pass may spend on (default 20) and how far ahead
# of the slate's Eastern midnight to look (default 30 hours).
# NHLE_CAPTURE_MAX_EVENTS=20
# NHLE_CAPTURE_HORIZON_H=30
# Set to 0 to keep the archive on this machine only (no engine-state sync).
# NHLE_STATE_SYNC=1
